{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdzTpty82rtDDvp4fnwXw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Plan\n\n1. **Call `shipping.gateway_ping()`** — Determine if the carrier gateway is currently reachable. This is safe and tells us if infrastructure is up.\n\n2. **Call `shipping.find_labels(shipment_id=4152)`** — Check whether a label was actually created despite the connection drop. This is the critical safety check before any retry.\n\n3. **Decide based on results:**\n   - If a label exists for 4152: **Do not call `create_label` again.** Report success and proceed.\n   - If no label exists AND gateway is reachable: **Call `shipping.create_label(shipment_id=4152, service_tier=\"express\")` once.** The request likely never reached the gateway.\n   - If no label exists AND gateway is unreachable: **Wait and retry the full sequence (ping → find_labels → create_label) after a delay.** Do not create_label while gateway is down.\n\n**Explicit statement:** I will call `create_label` again only if `find_labels` returns empty AND `gateway_ping` confirms the gateway is reachable—and only once to avoid duplicate dispatch."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":274,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":268,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
